 const report=()=>step(t('Reporting and traceability','报告及追溯'),'Retain stored Cq values, calls, fluorescence and omission flags. Report the calculated result, applied rule, reason, profile version and SHA-256. Review-only profiles issue provisional results, not a laboratory release decision.','保留保存的 Cq、判定、荧光及排除标记。报告计算结果、适用规则、原因、配置版本及 SHA-256。仅供审核的配置输出暂定结果，不构成实验室签发决定。','Every reported value is linked to its source reactions and active profile.','每项报告值均可追溯至来源反应和当前配置。');
