   step(t('Normalized ratio calculation','归一化比值计算'),'For one reference calculate R = E_target^(Ct_target,cal − Ct_target,sample) / E_reference^(Ct_reference,cal − Ct_reference,sample). E is the per-cycle amplification factor (ideal 2). The approximate ΔΔCq method sets both factors to 2. Efficiency-corrected analysis uses validated relative standard curves or explicitly supported factors.','单内标准基因时 R = E_target^(Ct_target,cal − Ct_target,sample) / E_reference^(Ct_reference,cal − Ct_reference,sample)。E 为每循环扩增因子，理想值为 2。近似 ΔΔCq 方法两因子均取 2；效率校正分析使用已验证的相对标准曲线或明确支持的因子。','Report fold change, not an absolute concentration or GMO percentage; absent reference or calibrator evidence prevents calculation.','报告相对倍数变化，不报告绝对浓度或转基因百分含量；缺少内标准基因或校准样品证据时不得计算。');
